+bun run src/cli.ts done 1
+bun run src/cli.ts delete 1
+bun run src/cli.ts stats
+```
+
+Each invocation writes exactly one JSON value to standard output. Errors additionally write a short diagnostic to standard error and exit non-zero. Writes use a sibling temporary file and atomic rename so an interrupted update does not partially overwrite the database.
